    "@value" : "This ontology represents a mapping from ACTUS contract terms to the relevant contract type(s) that comprise the ACTUS data dictionary as a controlled vocabulary and maps it to FIBO, providing the corresponding semantics and enabling integration of knowledge graphs based on FIBO with the ACTUS system."
